### lib-dart-api-engine
#### source: lib/dart/api-engine
# Flutter-only generated plugin manifests. This member depends on the Flutter
# SDK (transitively via diene_auth_engine), so `flutter pub get` writes files the
# pure-Dart siblings never produce. Tracking one of them made EVERY hook that
# runs `flutter pub get` fail pre-commit with "files were modified by this hook"
# — which is how it reddened Pre-Commit and Nix Flake Check in CI while local
# `flutter analyze` was rc=0. Entries match the accepted auth-engine set.
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
